    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP, used in the Fight phase once an enemy unit has picked its targets. Choose one of your EMPEROR'S CHILDREN CHARACTER units that at least one of those attacks is aimed at. For the rest of the phase, if one of its models that has not yet fought this phase is destroyed, roll a D6 (add 1 when the unit is the Favoured Champions of your army). If the result is 4+, keep the model in play: it may fight after the enemy unit completes its attacks, then it is removed from play.",
